                          curr = []               curr = [1]
                         /         \             /          \
             (Exclude 2)/           \(Inc 2) (Exc 2)/        \(Inc 2)
                       /             \             /          \
                 index 2             index 2     index 2     index 2
                curr = []           curr = [2]  curr = [1]  curr = [1, 2]
               /        \           /        \   /       \   /          \
         (Exc)/          \(Inc) (Exc)/        \(Inc)  /   \(Inc)   /     \(Inc)
             /            \         /          \     /     \      /       \
         index 3        index 3   index 3   index 3 index 3 index 3 index 3 index 3
        curr = []      curr=[3]  curr=[2]  curr=[2,3] curr=[1] curr=[1,3] curr=[1,2] curr=[1,2,3]
         (LEAF)         (LEAF)    (LEAF)    (LEAF)   (LEAF)   (LEAF)   (LEAF)    (LEAF)

Base Case Reached (index == nums.count):
 The subset at each leaf node is appended to ans
